00:40:14,000 --> 00:40:16,660
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pero baka hindi na tayo matulog, Chairman.

784
00:40:17,560 --> 00:40:18,860
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Baka wala nang tulugan.

785
00:40:18,880 --> 00:40:24,200
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But with that, we recognize the Chairman of the Senate Committee on Finance,

786
00:40:24,320 --> 00:40:25,060
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Sen. JV.

787
00:40:25,120 --> 00:40:27,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Mr. President.

788
00:40:27,820 --> 00:40:30,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. President, dear colleagues, fellow workers in government,

789
00:40:30,780 --> 00:40:32,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and most importantly, the Filipino people,

790
00:40:33,620 --> 00:40:37,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I humbly rise to present to you House Bill No. 10858

791
00:40:37,340 --> 00:40:40,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: or the proposed 2027 General Appropriations Bill

792
00:40:40,860 --> 00:40:42,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: under Committee Report No. 131.

793
00:40:43,500 --> 00:40:45,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It is both an honor and a great responsibility

794
00:40:45,580 --> 00:40:48,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: to lead the Senate Committee on Finance

795
00:40:48,060 --> 00:40:48,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: in the review and review of the bill.

796
00:40:48,880 --> 00:40:53,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and deliberation of the proposed 2027 General Appropriations Bill.

797
00:40:54,560 --> 00:40:56,460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This representation would like to express

798
00:40:56,460 --> 00:41:00,700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: his sincere gratitude to the Senate President,

799
00:41:00,920 --> 00:41:03,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Wingat Shajan, for his trust and confidence

800
00:41:03,040 --> 00:41:05,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: in delegating this noble task

801
00:41:05,400 --> 00:41:08,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: of shepherding this very important piece of legislation.

802
00:41:09,560 --> 00:41:11,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It is my sincere hope that our collective efforts

803
00:41:11,940 --> 00:41:15,960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: in refining the proposed 2027 National Budget

804
00:41:15,960 --> 00:41:18,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: will not only improve the lives of our people next year,

805
00:41:18,880 --> 00:41:22,120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: but be instrumental in shaping a better future

806
00:41:22,120 --> 00:41:23,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: for every Filipino.

807
00:41:24,300 --> 00:41:25,680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The budget deliberations this year

808
00:41:25,680 --> 00:41:27,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: have been nothing short of challenging.

809
00:41:28,080 --> 00:41:29,900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: In the middle of an impeachment trial,

810
00:41:30,100 --> 00:41:33,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: somehow, someway, we were able to squeeze in our briefings

811
00:41:33,780 --> 00:41:37,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: in an alleged and already tight schedule,

812
00:41:37,180 --> 00:41:40,120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: not to mention the very tight fiscal space.

813
00:41:40,900 --> 00:41:42,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I would like to take this opportunity

814
00:41:42,640 --> 00:41:45,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: to thank our distinguished Vice Chairpersons

815
00:41:45,040 --> 00:41:46,840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: who took on the duty.

816
00:41:47,520 --> 00:41:48,700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Together with their staff,

817
00:41:48,880 --> 00:41:50,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: the dedicated Senate employees,

818
00:41:51,020 --> 00:41:52,020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and most especially,

819
00:41:52,500 --> 00:41:55,460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: the men and women of the Legislative Budget Research

820
00:41:55,460 --> 00:41:56,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and Monitoring Office,

821
00:41:57,040 --> 00:41:58,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: or the LBRMO,

822
00:41:58,780 --> 00:42:00,520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: who are worked alongside with us,

823
00:42:01,240 --> 00:42:03,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: sacrificing their holidays and weekends.

824
00:42:04,240 --> 00:42:05,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And not to mention, Mr. President,

825
00:42:06,640 --> 00:42:08,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: that during the ASEAN week,

826
00:42:09,260 --> 00:42:14,220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: the LBRMO staff even had to bring their computers

827
00:42:14,220 --> 00:42:18,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: to the borrowed CA office in BGC.

828
00:42:18,880 --> 00:42:22,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: About 40 of them worked for the rest of the week

829
00:42:22,400 --> 00:42:24,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: so that there will be no delays

830
00:42:24,000 --> 00:42:26,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and we can finish the budget on time.

831
00:42:26,820 --> 00:42:29,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Maraming salamat po sa inyong sipag,

832
00:42:29,160 --> 00:42:30,420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: tsaga, at sakripisyo.

833
00:42:31,080 --> 00:42:34,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Your hard work and dedication have been invaluable

834
00:42:34,240 --> 00:42:37,120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: in bringing us to this stage of the budget process.

835
00:42:38,100 --> 00:42:38,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. President,

836
00:42:39,360 --> 00:42:41,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: when I took on the role of Chairperson

837
00:42:41,140 --> 00:42:42,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: of the Committee on Finance,

838
00:42:43,100 --> 00:42:44,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I've been very vocal from the beginning.

839
00:42:45,180 --> 00:42:47,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We do not intend to get caught up too much

840
00:42:47,360 --> 00:42:48,560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: on the complexities of numerics,

841
00:42:48,880 --> 00:42:51,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: numerical formulas in the budget process.

842
00:42:51,700 --> 00:42:53,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Our message has been clear and basic.

843
00:42:54,640 --> 00:42:56,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, we should go back to basics.

844
00:42:57,340 --> 00:42:58,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Basic services, that is.

845
00:42:59,320 --> 00:43:01,540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Before we focus on complicated matters,

846
00:43:01,980 --> 00:43:04,100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we should focus on what limited resources

847
00:43:04,100 --> 00:43:06,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we have in ensuring that the basic needs

848
00:43:06,920 --> 00:43:08,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: of our people are provided.

849
00:43:09,260 --> 00:43:10,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But, Mr. President,

850
00:43:10,340 --> 00:43:11,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: addressing these basic needs

851
00:43:11,720 --> 00:43:13,980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: is only one part of the equation.

852
00:43:14,600 --> 00:43:16,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We also need to restore economic momentum.

853
00:43:16,780 --> 00:43:18,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We need to accelerate the implementation

854
00:43:18,880 --> 00:43:21,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: of infrastructure projects,

855
00:43:21,620 --> 00:43:22,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: both national and local,

856
00:43:23,460 --> 00:43:25,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: that will stimulate economic activity

857
00:43:25,300 --> 00:43:28,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and lay down the foundation for long-term growth.

858
00:43:29,060 --> 00:43:31,460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We cannot sustain delivering basic services

859
00:43:31,460 --> 00:43:32,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: without a strong economy.

860
00:43:32,740 --> 00:43:36,560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And no one will appreciate economic growth

861
00:43:36,560 --> 00:43:39,700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: if it will not translate to better basic services.

862
00:43:40,860 --> 00:43:41,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This, Mr. President,

863
00:43:42,120 --> 00:43:43,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: is the direction we want to pursue

864
00:43:43,760 --> 00:43:46,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: in the 2027 National Budget,

865
00:43:47,220 --> 00:43:48,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Back to Basics.

866
00:43:48,880 --> 00:43:49,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But with a clear vision

867
00:43:49,940 --> 00:43:52,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: for economic recovery and nation building.

868
00:43:53,280 --> 00:43:53,980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ginong, Pangulo,

869
00:43:54,560 --> 00:43:56,960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: nanindigan po ako na dapat mumuhunan

870
00:43:56,960 --> 00:43:59,420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ang pamalaan sa pinakamalagang yaman

871
00:43:59,420 --> 00:44:01,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: o asset ng ating bansa.

872
00:44:01,940 --> 00:44:03,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yun ang kanyang mamamayan.

873
00:44:04,040 --> 00:44:06,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Bilang author at principal sponsor

874
00:44:06,280 --> 00:44:08,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ng Universal Health Care Act,

875
00:44:08,860 --> 00:44:11,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: itinataguin ko po ang pagtutuon na padsin

876
00:44:11,600 --> 00:44:14,420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: sa kalusugan ng ating mga kababayan.

877
00:44:15,020 --> 00:44:16,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Naniniwala po tayo

878
00:44:16,380 --> 00:44:18,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ng isang malusog na Pilipino,

879
00:44:18,880 --> 00:44:20,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: isang Pilipino na makabag-aambag

880
00:44:20,880 --> 00:44:22,960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: sa pagpapaunlad ng kanyang bansa.

881
00:44:24,200 --> 00:44:25,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya po sinigurado natin

882
00:44:25,740 --> 00:44:28,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na mapupondohan ang mga programa

883
00:44:28,160 --> 00:44:30,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at proyekto ng Department of Health

884
00:44:30,440 --> 00:44:32,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: pati na rin ang attached agencies

885
00:44:32,440 --> 00:44:33,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at corporations nito.

886
00:44:34,200 --> 00:44:35,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa versyon ng Senado,

887
00:44:35,980 --> 00:44:37,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: naglaan po tayo ng kabuang

888
00:44:37,380 --> 00:44:40,200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: P378.6 billion.

889
00:44:41,200 --> 00:44:42,620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasama po rito ang halos

890
00:44:42,620 --> 00:44:44,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: P3 billion na dagdagpondo

891
00:44:44,960 --> 00:44:47,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: para po sa preventive health services

892
00:44:47,640 --> 00:44:48,520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: tulad ng health promotion,

893
00:44:48,880 --> 00:44:50,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at procurement ng mga supply

894
00:44:50,880 --> 00:44:51,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: para sa immunization,

895
00:44:51,880 --> 00:44:52,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: nutrition,

896
00:44:52,880 --> 00:44:54,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at responsible parenting.

897
00:44:54,880 --> 00:44:56,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nakapaglaan din tayo

898
00:44:56,880 --> 00:44:58,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ng P5.4 billion

899
00:44:58,880 --> 00:44:59,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: para sa health...

900
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:07,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Facilities Enhancement Program, or HFEP, o ang programang may kinalaman sa construction at improvement ng mga ospital,

901
00:45:08,380 --> 00:45:14,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: pati na rin ang mga medical equipment na para sa diagnostics at treatment ng mga pasyente.

902
00:45:14,920 --> 00:45:22,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang gusto nga natin, mas palaksid pa ang kakayahan ng mga provincial at ilang locally funded hospitals.

903
00:45:22,060 --> 00:45:31,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Magiging maayos ang healthcare service delivery network at hindi na kinakailangan ng ating mga kababayan na lumos pa ng Maynila upang magpagamot.

904
00:45:32,860 --> 00:45:39,200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Makatutulong ito para ma-decongest ang ating mga APEX hospitals, hitting two birds with one stone, ika nga.

905
00:45:40,500 --> 00:45:47,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ngunit hindi po sapat na paramihin lamang ang ating mga pampublikong ospital o pagandahin ang kanilang mga pasilidad.

906
00:45:48,460 --> 00:45:52,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kailangan din natin tiyakin na may sapat na pondo ang Peel Health,

907
00:45:52,060 --> 00:45:57,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: upang mas marami Pilipino ang makinabang sa mas malawak na health benefits.

908
00:45:57,760 --> 00:46:03,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya naman, dinagdagan po ng inyong committee and finance ng 19.8 billion ang pondo ng Peel Health

909
00:46:03,920 --> 00:46:11,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: upang maibigay ng buo ang earmarked funds mula sa syntax collections para sa 2027.

910
00:46:12,040 --> 00:46:19,120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Dahil dito ay aabot na sa 94.2 billion ang subsidiya ng Peel Health para sa indirect contributors

911
00:46:19,120 --> 00:46:22,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at sa pagpapaganda at pagpapalawak ng kaibigan.

912
00:46:22,060 --> 00:46:30,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Gusto ko sana, gusto sana natin na mapataas ang pondo para sa Peel Health hanggang 100 billion.

913
00:46:30,720 --> 00:46:34,200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ngunit naintindihan natin na limited ang ating fiscal space.

914
00:46:35,520 --> 00:46:41,900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ayon sa Peel Health, target nila mapababa ang out-of-pocket health expenses ng ating makababayan

915
00:46:41,900 --> 00:46:48,560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: mula 41.2% tungo sa 37.8 pagsapit ng 2028.

916
00:46:48,560 --> 00:46:56,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ito pong dahilan kung bakit mahalagang maibigay natin sa Peel Health ang buong pondong nakalaan dito mula sa syntaxes.

917
00:46:57,220 --> 00:47:00,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa ganitong paraan, mas maraming benepisyo ang may bibigay ng Peel Health

918
00:47:00,640 --> 00:47:09,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at mababawasan ang gastos na kailangan hugutin ng ating makababayan mula sa sarili nila ng bulsa kapag sila ay nagkakasakit.

919
00:47:11,220 --> 00:47:18,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mahalaga rin po ang pagtuunan ng pansin ang mental health na sa pagdaan ng mga taon ay nakita natin na dapat bigyang atensyon,

920
00:47:18,560 --> 00:47:21,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: lalo na sa pag-usad ng modernong panahon.

921
00:47:22,360 --> 00:47:26,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaugnay nito, sinigurado po natin na mula sa mental health program ng DOH,

922
00:47:27,480 --> 00:47:33,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: malinaw na magagamit ang 300 milyon para sa pagbili at paghahatid ng mahalagang gamot,

923
00:47:34,100 --> 00:47:36,500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: alinsunod na rin po mismo sa Mental Health Act.

924
00:47:38,140 --> 00:47:44,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa ilalim din po ng Senate version ng budget, kapansin-pansin naman po ang pagbabaan ng medical assistance program,

925
00:47:45,580 --> 00:47:48,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: previously known as the Medical Assistance to Indigent Infant,

926
00:47:48,560 --> 00:47:52,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Financially Incapacitated Patients, o ang MAIFIP.

927
00:47:52,740 --> 00:47:55,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ngunit hindi po dapat ikabahalan ang ating makababayan.

928
00:47:56,640 --> 00:48:00,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi ito nangangahulugan na mababawasan ang tulong para sa mga pasyente.

929
00:48:01,580 --> 00:48:07,900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa halip, malaking bahagi ng pondo ay direktang nating inilaan sa mga ospital

930
00:48:07,900 --> 00:48:14,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: upang mas mapalawak at maayos at maipatupad ang Zero Balance Billing Program.

931
00:48:15,220 --> 00:48:17,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Basic lang po ang gusto natin dito.

932
00:48:18,560 --> 00:48:21,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mapawi ang alalahanin ng bawat pasyente,

933
00:48:22,800 --> 00:48:27,540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: hindi na niya dapat isipin kung saan kukuha ng pambayad sa pagpapagamot

934
00:48:27,540 --> 00:48:31,560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at ang tanging iintindihin na lamang niya ay ang pagpapagaling.

935
00:48:32,580 --> 00:48:38,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mababawasan po ang pangangailangan pumila at tumapit sa kung saan saang tanggapan

936
00:48:38,640 --> 00:48:42,500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: para makahingi ng mga guarantee letters na pambayad sa hospital bills.

937
00:48:43,680 --> 00:48:47,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. President, while we take healthcare accessible,

938
00:48:47,340 --> 00:48:48,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we make healthcare accessible,

939
00:48:49,340 --> 00:48:53,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: it is equally important that we ensure that our people are well-nourished.

940
00:48:54,440 --> 00:48:57,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Having a healthcare system that we can always rely on is good,

941
00:48:57,980 --> 00:49:00,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: but we believe that prevention is still better than cure.

942
00:49:02,040 --> 00:49:06,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: A pandemic is similar to a natural disaster that is almost beyond our control.

943
00:49:07,960 --> 00:49:11,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Though difficult, what we can prevent is hunger and malnutrition.

944
00:49:11,960 --> 00:49:15,460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We must see to it that every Filipino is able to eat every day.

945
00:49:15,720 --> 00:49:16,460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This will only be possible...

946
00:49:17,340 --> 00:49:19,460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We continue to push for food security.

947
00:49:20,780 --> 00:49:26,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: For this to come to fruition, we must ensure the productivity of our farmlands for 2027.

948
00:49:26,860 --> 00:49:30,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The Department of Agriculture and its attached agencies and corporations,

949
00:49:31,140 --> 00:49:36,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: including irrigation support, will have a combined budget of around P251 billion.

950
00:49:37,140 --> 00:49:40,520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This will ensure that our farmers receive the support they need,

951
00:49:40,820 --> 00:49:45,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: from sowing seeds, fertilization of crops, to harvesting and selling of goods.

952
00:49:47,340 --> 00:49:53,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Your Committee has also re-aligned more than P4 billion for the National Rice Program to help boost rice production.

953
00:49:53,860 --> 00:49:57,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And with the continuing threat of drought and El Niño,

954
00:49:57,720 --> 00:50:02,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we have provided P1 billion for the DA's Quick Response Fund, or the QRF,

955
00:50:02,700 --> 00:50:08,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and P250 million for the Agri-Recover Program to help farmers affected by these conditions.

956
00:50:08,960 --> 00:50:11,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We cannot stop Super El Niño from happening,

957
00:50:11,640 --> 00:50:16,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: but we can prepare and be ready to respond the moment it makes its presence felt.

958
00:50:17,340 --> 00:50:21,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. President, this is through the efforts of our distinguished Vice-Chair,

959
00:50:22,300 --> 00:50:24,220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Senator Francis Pangilinan,

960
00:50:24,620 --> 00:50:29,100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: who is very knowledgeable of the needs and challenges of the agricultural sector,

961
00:50:29,840 --> 00:50:31,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: being an organic farmer himself.

962
00:50:32,300 --> 00:50:32,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, sir.

963
00:50:34,220 --> 00:50:35,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: In relation to this,

964
00:50:36,820 --> 00:50:42,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: National Irrigation Administration will receive P47.5 billion in subsidy

965
00:50:42,360 --> 00:50:44,900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: to allow the continued flow of water for farming.

966
00:50:45,460 --> 00:50:46,220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: However,

967
00:50:47,340 --> 00:50:51,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: the amount of water is only one of the many demands of our farmers.

968
00:50:52,220 --> 00:50:56,020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Para sa mga vegetable farmers ng Benguet at Mountain Province,

969
00:50:56,640 --> 00:50:59,520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: bagama't nabibiyayaan ng mga aning gulay,

970
00:51:00,140 --> 00:51:00,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kadalasan naman ay

971
00:51:01,240 --> 00:51:06,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: inaabutan ng pagkabulok ang mga kalakal dahil sa

972
00:51:07,080 --> 00:51:10,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kawalan ng angkop na lugar upang pag-imbakan.

973
00:51:10,040 --> 00:51:13,120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Buong pagmamalaki po nating ibinabalita ang paglalaan natin ng mahigit isang bilyon

974
00:51:13,120 --> 00:51:17,120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: para sa pagpapatayo ng Benguet Agri-Pinoy Trading Center,

975
00:51:17,340 --> 00:51:21,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at Cold Storage Facility sa Barlig, Mountain Province.

976
00:51:21,340 --> 00:51:29,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ito po ay magsisilbing solusyon sa matagal nang problema ng ating mga kababayang vegetable farmers.

977
00:51:29,340 --> 00:51:37,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Maliban po ito sa 200 million na inilaan pa sa pagpapatayo naman ng cold storage facility sa Oriental Mindoro.

978
00:51:37,340 --> 00:51:41,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa halip na mabulok at masayang ang ating pinaghirapang ani,

979
00:51:41,340 --> 00:51:45,840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ito ay maiiimbak nang mas matagal

980
00:51:45,840 --> 00:51:47,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at sa angkop na kondisyon,

981
00:51:47,180 --> 00:51:51,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ang ilang produkto ay maaaring tumagal ng hanggang anim na buwan.

982
00:51:51,180 --> 00:51:58,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mabibigyan din nito ang ating mga magsasaka ng pagkakataong maibenta ang kanilang mga produkto sa mas magandang presyo.

983
00:51:58,180 --> 00:52:02,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi lamang po ang ating mga magsasaka makikinabang dito.

984
00:52:02,180 --> 00:52:05,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: by reducing post-harvest losses,

985
00:52:05,180 --> 00:52:10,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we can help maintain a stable food supply and prevent sudden increases in food prices,

986
00:52:10,180 --> 00:52:14,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: particularly during calamities and periods of shortage.

987
00:52:14,180 --> 00:52:16,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa madaling salita,

988
00:52:16,180 --> 00:52:18,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. President,

989
00:52:18,180 --> 00:52:23,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: mas kaunting nasasayang at mas malaking kita para sa ating mga magsasaka,

990
00:52:23,180 --> 00:52:29,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at matatag na supply ng abot-kayang pagkain para sa ating mga kababayan.

991
00:52:29,180 --> 00:52:30,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasabay ng pagpapalakas ng lokal na produksyon,

992
00:52:30,180 --> 00:52:33,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: dapat ding maging maingat tayo

993
00:52:33,180 --> 00:52:38,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: sa pag-angkat ng mga produktong agrikultural.

994
00:52:38,180 --> 00:52:42,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Importation should only be allowed when there is no local harvest

995
00:52:42,180 --> 00:52:45,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: or when domestic supply is genuinely insufficient.

996
00:52:46,180 --> 00:52:49,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi makatarungan na sa panahon ng anihan

997
00:52:49,180 --> 00:52:52,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ay makikipagkompetensya pa ang ating mga magsasaka

998
00:52:52,180 --> 00:52:55,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: sa mas murang imported na produkto

999
00:52:55,180 --> 00:53:00,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na nagiging dahilan ng pagbaba ng presyo ng kanilang ani at pagkalugi.

1000
00:53:00,180 --> 00:53:04,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Dapat nakabatay sa aktwal na datos ng produksyon,

1001
00:53:04,180 --> 00:53:06,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: imbentaryo at panahon ng anihan,

1002
00:53:06,180 --> 00:53:09,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ang anumang desisyon sa importasyon.

1003
00:53:09,180 --> 00:53:12,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kung may sapat na lokal na ani,

1004
00:53:12,180 --> 00:53:13,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: unahin nating bilhin

1005
00:53:13,180 --> 00:53:17,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at suportahan ang produkto ng ating mga magsasaka.

1006
00:53:17,180 --> 00:53:20,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Importation must address real shortages

1007
00:53:20,180 --> 00:53:26,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: that undermine the livelihoods of the very farmers who are trying to help.

1008
00:53:26,180 --> 00:53:28,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We advocate for food security

1009
00:53:28,180 --> 00:53:31,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: because we believe that every Filipino should be well fed.

1010
00:53:31,180 --> 00:53:37,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: A Filipino that eats regularly and is well-nourished will do better in life.

1011
00:53:37,180 --> 00:53:38,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But before that,

1012
00:53:38,180 --> 00:53:41,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we want our people to do good in school.

1013
00:53:41,180 --> 00:53:42,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. President,

1014
00:53:42,180 --> 00:53:45,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: learners from Kinder to Grade 1

1015
00:53:45,180 --> 00:53:50,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: will benefit from the Department of Education's school-based feeding program.

1016
00:53:50,180 --> 00:53:53,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Teachers will provide the food for their brains.

1017
00:53:53,180 --> 00:53:55,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: DepEd will provide the food for their tummies.

1018
00:53:55,180 --> 00:54:00,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: DepEd will allocate 11 billion for its school-based feeding program,

1019
00:54:00,180 --> 00:54:03,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: which shall form part of its total 2027 budget,

1020
00:54:03,180 --> 00:54:07,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: amounting to 915.4 billion.

1021
00:54:07,180 --> 00:54:10,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We would like to thank our Vice Chair,

1022
00:54:10,180 --> 00:54:11,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Senator Bambachino,

1023
00:54:11,180 --> 00:54:14,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: for pushing for the funding for this program

1024
00:54:14,180 --> 00:54:17,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: that will contribute to the growth and development of our pupils

1025
00:54:17,180 --> 00:54:19,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and help prevent stunting.

1026
00:54:19,180 --> 00:54:23,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Again, thank you very much to Senator Bambachino.

1027
00:54:23,180 --> 00:54:25,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: For higher education,

1028
00:54:25,180 --> 00:54:30,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we have allocated a total of 138.2 billion

1029
00:54:30,180 --> 00:54:34,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: for our state universities and colleges or SUCs.

1030
00:54:34,180 --> 00:54:36,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This will support their operations,

1031
00:54:36,180 --> 00:54:38,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: academic programs,

1032
00:54:38,180 --> 00:54:40,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and the continued construction,

1033
00:54:40,180 --> 00:54:41,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: rehabilitation,

1034
00:54:41,180 --> 00:54:44,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and improvement of school buildings and other facilities.

1035
00:54:44,180 --> 00:54:49,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Included in this allocation is 7.5 million for each SUC

1036
00:54:49,180 --> 00:54:51,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: under the Smart Campus Project,

1037
00:54:51,180 --> 00:54:53,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: which aims to improve internet connectivity

1038
00:54:53,180 --> 00:54:59,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and support digital learning across more than 100 campuses nationwide.

1039
00:54:59,180 --> 00:55:01,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Dear colleagues,

1040
00:55:01,180 --> 00:55:05,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: this program will make information technology more accessible to our students.

1041
00:55:05,180 --> 00:55:08,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This was advocated by my brother and seatmate,

1042
00:55:08,180 --> 00:55:09,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Vice Chair,

1043
00:55:09,180 --> 00:55:11,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Senator Joel Villanueva.

1044
00:55:11,180 --> 00:55:12,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you very much,

1045
00:55:12,180 --> 00:55:13,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Senator Joel.

1046
00:55:13,180 --> 00:55:17,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: If we keep our students with the proper learning tools,

1047
00:55:17,180 --> 00:55:19,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: they will be ready to find jobs

1048
00:55:19,180 --> 00:55:21,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and contribute to our economy.

1049
00:55:21,180 --> 00:55:23,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But simultaneously,

1050
00:55:23,180 --> 00:55:25,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we find ways to generate jobs,

1051
00:55:25,180 --> 00:55:28,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: to accommodate our graduates and job seekers.

1052
00:55:28,180 --> 00:55:32,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This is where infrastructure development comes in,

1053
00:55:32,180 --> 00:55:35,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: more opportunities for our people.

1054
00:55:35,180 --> 00:55:37,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nung sumambulat po,

1055
00:55:37,180 --> 00:55:39,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ang flood control scandal,

1056
00:55:39,180 --> 00:55:42,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: perhaps the greatest corruption scandal

1057
00:55:42,180 --> 00:55:44,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: in the history of the Philippines.

1058
00:55:44,180 --> 00:55:46,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Halos tumigol po ang lahat

1059
00:55:46,180 --> 00:55:48,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ng ating infrastructure projects.

1060
00:55:48,180 --> 00:55:51,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasabay din ito ang paghinto ng oportunidad

1061
00:55:51,180 --> 00:55:54,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: para sa marami sa ating mga kababayan.

1062
00:55:54,180 --> 00:55:56,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Dahil sa iskandalo,

1063
00:55:56,180 --> 00:55:59,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: naging mabagal ang infrastructure spending

1064
00:55:59,180 --> 00:56:04,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at labis na naapektuhan ang kumpiyansa ng mga investors.

1065
00:56:04,180 --> 00:56:06,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Naniniwala po tayo,

1066
00:56:06,180 --> 00:56:07,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ginong Pangulo,

1067
00:56:07,180 --> 00:56:09,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na hindi dapat tumigil ang lahat

1068
00:56:09,180 --> 00:56:11,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: dahil sa flood control scandal.

1069
00:56:11,180 --> 00:56:14,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hayaan po natin magpatuloy ang mga investigasyon,

1070
00:56:14,180 --> 00:56:16,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ang pagsampan ng mga kaso,

1071
00:56:16,180 --> 00:56:19,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at pagpapanagot sa lahat ng mga sangkot.

1072
00:56:19,180 --> 00:56:22,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa bahagi po naman po natin,

1073
00:56:22,180 --> 00:56:24,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: dapat na magpatuloy tayo

1074
00:56:24,180 --> 00:56:27,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: sa pagsusulong ng infrastructure development

1075
00:56:27,180 --> 00:56:29,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na makapaglilika ng hanap buhay

1076
00:56:29,180 --> 00:56:33,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at maghahatid ng ginhawa sa ating bayan.

1077
00:56:33,180 --> 00:56:34,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. President,

1078
00:56:34,180 --> 00:56:35,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: for many years,

1079
00:56:35,180 --> 00:56:38,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: infrastructure development had to compete

1080
00:56:38,180 --> 00:56:40,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: with other pressing fiscal obligations,

1081
00:56:40,180 --> 00:56:42,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: including debt payments.

1082
00:56:42,180 --> 00:56:45,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: As investments in critical infrastructure

1083
00:56:45,180 --> 00:56:47,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: were constrained or deferred,

1084
00:56:47,180 --> 00:56:50,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: industries that depend on reliable roads,

1085
00:56:50,180 --> 00:56:52,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ports, transportation,

1086
00:56:52,180 --> 00:56:55,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and other public facilities also felt the impact.

1087
00:56:55,180 --> 00:56:58,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Delayed projects mean delayed investments,

1088
00:56:58,180 --> 00:56:59,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: fewer jobs,

1089
00:56:59,180 --> 00:57:02,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and missed opportunities for economic growth.

1090
00:57:02,180 --> 00:57:04,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ito po ang dahilan kung bakit

1091
00:57:04,180 --> 00:57:06,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: malaga ang ating panukalang

1092
00:57:06,180 --> 00:57:09,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Master Plan for Infrastructure and National Development

1093
00:57:09,180 --> 00:57:11,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: or BIND Act.

1094
00:57:11,180 --> 00:57:15,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Layunin nito magkaroon ng malinaw at pangmatagalang plano

1095
00:57:15,180 --> 00:57:17,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: para sa mga pangunahing infrastruktura

1096
00:57:17,180 --> 00:57:22,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: upang ang maproyekto ay nakabatay sa tunay na pangangailangan,

1097
00:57:22,180 --> 00:57:25,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kahandaan at benepisyo sa ekonomiya,

1098
00:57:25,180 --> 00:57:29,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: hindi sa pansarili at pansamantalang interes.

1099
00:57:29,180 --> 00:57:32,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We must accelerate growth without sacrificing accountability.

1100
00:57:32,180 --> 00:57:39,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Bilisan natin ang pagpapatubad ng mahalagang proyekto,

1101
00:57:39,180 --> 00:57:42,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ngunit yakinak natin na kumpleto ang dokumento,

1102
00:57:42,180 --> 00:57:45,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: malinaw ang pagpili ng proyekto,

1103
00:57:45,180 --> 00:57:49,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at bawat pisong ginagastos ay may tunay

1104
00:57:49,180 --> 00:57:52,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na panginabang sa ating mga kababayan.

1105
00:57:52,180 --> 00:57:54,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang ating kailangan,

1106
00:57:54,180 --> 00:57:58,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: mga proyektong may silbi at mga proyektong magsisilbi.

1107
00:57:58,180 --> 00:58:01,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Para po sa Department of Public Works and Labor,

1108
00:58:01,180 --> 00:58:04,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: o Public Works and Highways, o DPWH,

1109
00:58:04,180 --> 00:58:11,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: makakatanggap po sila ng higit 587 bilyon para sa susunod na taon.

1110
00:58:11,180 --> 00:58:14,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nakapaloob po rito ang iba't ibang infrastructure projects

1111
00:58:14,180 --> 00:58:18,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na maglalatlag ng ating landas patungo sa kaunlaran.

1112
00:58:18,180 --> 00:58:25,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ibinileg po ng inyong komiti ang 33.097 bilyon na bahagi ng pondong binawas

1113
00:58:25,180 --> 00:58:29,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: para sa Foreign Assisted Projects, o FAPs,

1114
00:58:29,180 --> 00:58:33,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kabilang sa mahalangang proyektong nais natin ipagpatuloy

1115
00:58:33,180 --> 00:58:39,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ang Bataan-Cavite Interlink Bridge, Laguna Lakeshore Road Network,

1116
00:58:39,180 --> 00:58:42,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at Pasig-Marikina River Channel Improvement Project.

1117
00:58:44,180 --> 00:58:49,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Upang mapawi ang pangamba o agang-abang ng ating mga kababayan,

1118
00:58:49,180 --> 00:58:55,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: naniniligan po tayo na dapat ay tapusin muna ang mahindi patapos na flood management program.

1119
00:58:55,180 --> 00:58:57,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Dapat bigyang prioridad ang mga ito,

1120
00:58:57,180 --> 00:59:00,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kaysa magpanukala ng mga panibago.

1121
00:59:00,180 --> 00:59:06,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa ating mga manggagawa na hindi lamang instrumental sa infrastructure development,

1122
00:59:06,180 --> 00:59:10,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: bagos ay matuturing din natin na haligin ang ating ekonomiya,

1123
00:59:10,180 --> 00:59:13,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: hindi po namin kayo nalilimutan.

1124
00:59:13,180 --> 00:59:19,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang kabawang budget ng Department of Labor and Employment, o DOLE,

1125
00:59:19,180 --> 00:59:24,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: para sa susunod na taon ay nagkakahalaga ng 53.8 bilyon.

1126
00:59:24,180 --> 00:59:26,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ito po ay para sa kapakanan ng...

1127
00:59:26,180 --> 00:59:29,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at proteksyon ng mga manggagawa.

1128
00:59:32,180 --> 00:59:37,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nagbigay din na karagdagang budget ang inyong komitee ng 250 milyon para sa Action Fund

1129
00:59:37,180 --> 00:59:39,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ng Department of Migrant Workers,

1130
00:59:39,180 --> 00:59:45,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at 600 milyon para sa Emergency Repatriation Fund

1131
00:59:45,180 --> 00:59:50,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ng Overseas Workers Welfare Administration, or OWA.

1132
00:59:50,180 --> 00:59:54,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Gusto po nating tiyakin na may sapat na pondo para agad na matulungan,

1133
00:59:54,180 --> 01:00:00,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at mapawi ang ating mga OFW kapag may krisis sa bansa ang kanilang pinagtatrabahuhan.

1134
01:00:01,800 --> 01:00:06,500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Malaki po ang sakripisyo ng ating mga OFW para sa kanilang pamilya at sa ating bansa.

1135
01:00:07,340 --> 01:00:13,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya kapag sila naman ang nangailangan ng tulong, dapat nandyan agad ang ating gobyerno para umalalay sa kanila.

1136
01:00:14,880 --> 01:00:21,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Malaga po mabanggit ang Sugarcane Workers Assistance Scholarship para sa mga sugarcane industry workers

1137
01:00:21,600 --> 01:00:29,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at sugarcane farmers at kanilang mga dependents na makakatulong sa pagpapagaan ng bayarin sa matrikula.

1138
01:00:29,000 --> 01:00:39,100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pagkakaloob ng stipend at maging thesis allowance, 20 milyon ay nilaan natin sa programa ito na nakalagak sa DOLE-OSEC.

1139
01:00:40,440 --> 01:00:44,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Parang po sa ating makawani at mamagagawa sa pamalaan,

1140
01:00:45,180 --> 01:00:56,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: isinama po natin sa ating Senate version ng 2027 Budget ang pagdagdag ng 1,000 piso para sa buwanang Personal Economic Relief Allowance o PERA

1141
01:00:56,860 --> 01:00:59,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kasama po na magbebukas.

1142
01:00:59,000 --> 01:01:08,700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang pinipisyo mula rito ang ating mga guro na katulad din ng mga manggagawa at mga empleyado sa pribadong sektor ay naapekton din ng pagtaas sa mga bilihin.

1143
01:01:09,780 --> 01:01:18,420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ito po ay kaalinsabay ng ating panukala na itaas ang sahod ng mga guro na dalangin natin ay ganap ng maisabatas.

1144
01:01:19,620 --> 01:01:28,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: To help our fellow Filipinos get to work faster and turn home safely, we will continue improving our transportation system.

1145
01:01:29,000 --> 01:01:39,660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We restored 4.7 billion GOP counterpart and another 15 billion for the continued construction of the Metro Manila Subway Project

1146
01:01:39,660 --> 01:01:45,500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and another 15 billion for the North-South Commuter Railway, both under the JICA load.

1147
01:01:47,260 --> 01:01:51,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: To further improve the commuting experience for so many of our people on the road,

1148
01:01:51,800 --> 01:01:58,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: the Senate version of the budget also provides funding for the NCR Busway Project and for the Active Transport Bike Share System,

1149
01:01:59,000 --> 01:02:01,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and Safe Pathways Program.

1150
01:02:01,820 --> 01:02:10,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: In all, funding for these two important initiatives amounts collectively to 146.5 billion.

1151
01:02:11,020 --> 01:02:16,500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Taken together, these projects will make daily travel faster and more convenient, especially for our workers.

1152
01:02:18,200 --> 01:02:24,840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We have likewise ensured adequate funding for the construction and rehabilitation for airports and seaports nationwide.

1153
01:02:24,840 --> 01:02:28,840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: In particular, we allocated an additional 600 million pesos,

1154
01:02:29,000 --> 01:02:34,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: for various airport development and improvement projects across the country,

1155
01:02:34,000 --> 01:02:40,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: with the aim of providing our Kababayans with safer, more reliable, and more convenient air travel

1156
01:02:40,000 --> 01:02:44,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: while enhancing connectivity and supporting economic growth in our regions.

1157
01:02:44,000 --> 01:02:54,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: All these initiatives form part of the 294.57 billion budget of the Department of Transportation, or DOTR, for 2027.

1158
01:02:54,000 --> 01:02:57,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: As we continue to improve transportation,

1159
01:02:57,000 --> 01:02:58,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we also want more Filipino families to

1160
01:02:58,900 --> 01:03:01,900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: have decent and affordable homes.

1161
01:03:01,900 --> 01:03:06,900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: For 2027, the Department of Human Settlements and Urban Development, or DSHUD,

1162
01:03:06,900 --> 01:03:11,900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and its attached agencies or corporations will receive a total of 6.4 billion.

1163
01:03:11,900 --> 01:03:22,900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This includes your committee's augmentation of 1.005 billion for the National Housing Corporation and Socialized Housing Finance Corporation.

1164
01:03:23,900 --> 01:03:28,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: While the budget for the expanded 4PH program was reduced to 600 million in the House budget,

1165
01:03:28,780 --> 01:03:38,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we have provided an additional 504.8 billion for the Community Mortgage Program under the Social Housing Finance Corporation.

1166
01:03:38,780 --> 01:03:45,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We have also added P400 million for the housing projects under the National Housing Authority or NHA.

1167
01:03:46,520 --> 01:03:52,020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. President, gusto lang naman natin na mas maraming pamilyang Pilipino magkaroon ng sariling bahay.

1168
01:03:53,120 --> 01:03:55,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Para naman po sa ating mga kumbaya na naghihikahos,

1169
01:03:56,520 --> 01:04:02,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: makakaasa po kayo ng kaliga mula sa Department of Social Welfare Development o DSWD.

1170
01:04:02,720 --> 01:04:10,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Para po sa susunod na taon, ang kabuang budget po ng DSWD ay P253.3 billion.

1171
01:04:10,740 --> 01:04:17,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang Assistance to Individuals in Crisis Situations o AICS magkakahalaga ng P48.1 billion,

1172
01:04:17,920 --> 01:04:24,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: mas mababa ng halos P10 billion kumpara sa nasa original na General Appropriations Bill.

1173
01:04:25,200 --> 01:04:32,020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Samantalang, P99 billion ang pondo para sa Pantawid Pamilyang Pilipino Program or 4Ps.

1174
01:04:32,720 --> 01:04:36,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ngunit hindi lamang po panay-pamigay o ayudang DSWD.

1175
01:04:37,380 --> 01:04:41,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mayroon din po silang Sustainable Livelihood Program o SLP.

1176
01:04:42,080 --> 01:04:45,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ito ang kanilang Community-Based Capacity Building Program

1177
01:04:45,280 --> 01:04:50,540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: para mapabuti ang antasang pamumuhay ng mga hihirap at vulnerable.

1178
01:04:51,460 --> 01:04:59,080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pagkakaluban po ng puhunan ang isang grupo ng mga mamamayan sa isang komunidad na nais makapagnegosyo.

1179
01:04:59,080 --> 01:05:02,080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kailangan lamang po ang na-accredited ng DSWD

1180
01:05:02,720 --> 01:05:04,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: sa kanilang grupo o kooperatiba.

1181
01:05:05,180 --> 01:05:09,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: P4.2 billion ang pondo na inilaan po natin para sa programang ito.

1182
01:05:11,420 --> 01:05:19,100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasama rin po ang DSWD sa mga ahensya na naghahanda para sa inaasahang paghagupit ng Super El Nino sa ating bansa.

1183
01:05:20,460 --> 01:05:22,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Para sa pagpaparating na tagtuyot,

1184
01:05:24,300 --> 01:05:31,120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: nagkakahalaga po ng P1.4 billion ang nakatakdang panggastos ng DSWD para sa iba't ibang mga programa

1185
01:05:32,720 --> 01:05:34,080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: pagpapadaloy ng tulong.

1186
01:05:35,180 --> 01:05:39,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Bungo naman po ito ng pagsusumikat ng ating Vice Chair Centaurisa Ontiveros

1187
01:05:39,760 --> 01:05:44,540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na nagsusulong at namapondohan ang mga programang naglalayon may padama

1188
01:05:44,540 --> 01:05:50,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ang pag-aalaga at pag-aaruga sa ating mga kababayan na nangangailangan.

1189
01:05:50,160 --> 01:05:52,620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Muli, maraming salamat, Centaurisa.

1190
01:05:53,720 --> 01:05:58,980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Para naman po alalaya ng ating mga marginalized at disadvantaged na mga kababayan,

1191
01:05:59,560 --> 01:06:02,700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: makatatanggap po ang National Anti-Poverty Commission o NAPA.

1192
01:06:02,700 --> 01:06:05,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Muli, maraming salamat, Centaurisa.

1193
01:06:05,160 --> 01:06:08,960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nagkakahalaga ng P559.9 milyon pesos.

1194
01:06:09,700 --> 01:06:14,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang pondo pong ito ay makatutulong sa kanilang mga proyekto at mga programa

1195
01:06:14,720 --> 01:06:18,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kaugnay ng poverty reduction at mga social reform programs.

1196
01:06:20,720 --> 01:06:24,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: As we work hard to ensure the provision of fundamental needs,

1197
01:06:24,660 --> 01:06:31,500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we must also continue to make efforts for the protection and safety for people from threats domestic and foreign.

1198
01:06:31,500 --> 01:06:34,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: For the Philippine National Police or PNP,

1199
01:06:34,880 --> 01:06:44,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: your committee has augmented its 2027 proposed budget by 2.9 billion for a total of 245.2 billion.

1200
01:06:45,920 --> 01:06:49,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This would strengthen police operations, upgrade their facilities,

1201
01:06:49,500 --> 01:06:53,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and back their fight against terrorism and other security threats.

1202
01:06:54,460 --> 01:06:58,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: One of the major initiatives that we funded within the PNP's budget

1203
01:06:58,380 --> 01:07:01,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: is the completion of the Police Regional Office,

1204
01:07:01,500 --> 01:07:04,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: which is in the newly created Negros Island Region.

1205
01:07:05,040 --> 01:07:09,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: As both author and principal sponsor of the Negros Island Region Act,

1206
01:07:10,400 --> 01:07:11,960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: which we passed last 2024,

1207
01:07:12,800 --> 01:07:17,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we are pleased to finally see the effects of our law coming to full fruition

1208
01:07:17,320 --> 01:07:21,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: through a more focused and rooted national government presence for all Negrenses.

1209
01:07:23,120 --> 01:07:29,100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We also enhanced the budget of the Bureau of Fire Protection or BFP by 922 million,

1210
01:07:29,100 --> 01:07:31,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: bringing it to 39.3 billion.

1211
01:07:32,040 --> 01:07:35,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This will allow the hiring of 2,000 more firefighters,

1212
01:07:36,380 --> 01:07:37,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: the purchase of ambulances,

1213
01:07:38,140 --> 01:07:40,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and improvements in emergency response.

1214
01:07:41,740 --> 01:07:46,200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Meanwhile, the Bureau of Jail Management and Penology or the BJMP

1215
01:07:46,200 --> 01:07:53,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: would get 34.4 billion to further upgrade the administration and conditions of our local jails.

1216
01:07:54,860 --> 01:08:01,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: These are all part of the proposed 2027 budget of the Department of the Interior and Local Government or DILG,

1217
01:08:01,500 --> 01:08:05,120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: which our committee has boosted by more than 4 billion pesos,

1218
01:08:05,320 --> 01:08:10,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: bringing the overall budget of DILG to 334.9 billion.

1219
01:08:11,480 --> 01:08:17,120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We have always believed in the courage and perseverance that our police and other uniformed personnel possess.

1220
01:08:17,380 --> 01:08:24,220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: What is few, however, are the tools and equipment that will enhance their skills and amplify their capabilities.

1221
01:08:25,720 --> 01:08:31,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. President, dear colleagues, this was made possible through the collective efforts of our Senate President,

1222
01:08:31,500 --> 01:08:36,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Win Gatchalian, our Vice-Chair, Senator Panfilo Lacson, and his representation.

1223
01:08:37,880 --> 01:08:44,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Perhaps there is no other person who fully understands the needs of our police than someone who became Chief PNP himself.

1224
01:08:45,920 --> 01:08:50,220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This humble representation would like to express its deep gratitude to Senator Lacson

1225
01:08:50,220 --> 01:08:56,540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: for keeping an eagle eye in scrutinizing the proposed 2027 budget as a whole.

1226
01:08:57,180 --> 01:08:58,540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Maraming salamat po, Sen. Ping.

1227
01:08:59,380 --> 01:09:01,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. President, aside from keeping,

1228
01:09:01,500 --> 01:09:05,540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: our community secure, we must also reinforce the defenses of our country,

1229
01:09:05,920 --> 01:09:09,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: especially with the continued challenges in the West Philippine Sea.

1230
01:09:10,200 --> 01:09:14,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The committee also raised the budget of the Department of National Defense or DND

1231
01:09:14,180 --> 01:09:19,620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: by 1.73 billion to 326.9 billion in 2027.

1232
01:09:20,460 --> 01:09:28,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This is on top of the 50 billion already earmarked for the continued modernization of the Armed Forces of the Philippines,

1233
01:09:28,060 --> 01:09:31,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: which, by the way, is in the program appropriation.

1234
01:09:31,500 --> 01:09:40,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This is probably the biggest ever funding for the EMP modernization in the program appropriations at 50 billion pesos.

1235
01:09:41,340 --> 01:09:45,620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Included in the additional allocation is 750 million for the Philippine Navy,

1236
01:09:46,400 --> 01:09:49,120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: raising its budget to 71.2 billion.

1237
01:09:49,900 --> 01:09:53,080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The nine key infrastructure projects in the Kalayaan Island Group,

1238
01:09:54,100 --> 01:09:57,020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: including Pag-asa Island, will be funded by this.

1239
01:09:57,020 --> 01:09:59,980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We intend to upgrade our facilities in Kalayaan,

1240
01:10:00,080 --> 01:10:01,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: increase our presence in the West,

1241
01:10:01,500 --> 01:10:05,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: for the Philippine Coast Guard or the PCG,

1242
01:10:05,840 --> 01:10:13,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we augmented its budget to 45.6 billion by adding 146.8 million for the acquisition of training helicopters.

1243
01:10:15,180 --> 01:10:19,500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. President, the presence of our Navy and Coast Guard brings confidence to our fishermen

1244
01:10:19,500 --> 01:10:23,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: who only wish to peacefully earn an honest living in the West Philippine Sea,

1245
01:10:23,820 --> 01:10:25,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: without threat or intimidation.

1246
01:10:26,860 --> 01:10:30,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kalusugan, pagkain, edukasyon, trabaho at siguridad.

1247
01:10:30,300 --> 01:10:30,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yan.

1248
01:10:31,500 --> 01:10:34,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At po, ang nais nating pagtuunan ng pansin

1249
01:10:34,280 --> 01:10:39,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: sa pagbabalangkas at deliberasyon natin ng 2027 National Budget.

1250
01:10:40,360 --> 01:10:41,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Back to basics.

1251
01:10:41,880 --> 01:10:43,620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Unahin natin ang pagsisiguro

1252
01:10:43,620 --> 01:10:47,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ng mas maayos at epesyenteng nakakarating sa ating mamamayan,

1253
01:10:48,040 --> 01:10:49,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ang basic services.

1254
01:10:51,500 --> 01:10:54,560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Batayang serbisyo ang batayan natin ng tagumpay.

1255
01:10:54,560 --> 01:10:57,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But as I mentioned at the outset,

1256
01:10:58,080 --> 01:11:00,680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: providing basic services is only part of the equation.

1257
