Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: From 15 billion to 9.9.

4923
03:16:52,600 --> 03:16:55,640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Davao is three or four times bigger than Metro Manila.

4924
03:16:55,640 --> 03:16:56,640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: We don't want...

4925
03:16:56,840 --> 03:16:58,900
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: We don't want the gridlock in Metro Manila to hit them.

4926
03:16:59,260 --> 03:16:59,920
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Eto, maganda to.

4927
03:17:00,060 --> 03:17:02,760
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Laguna Lakeshore Road Network.

4928
03:17:03,480 --> 03:17:04,980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Dami na pinag-usapan dito.

4929
03:17:05,720 --> 03:17:07,620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Inaaway ko sa klasa, design na to.

4930
03:17:08,340 --> 03:17:10,960
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: At sinabi sa akin ni Secretary Vinci, singiling ko siya,

4931
03:17:11,920 --> 03:17:13,100
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: binigyan ko sila ng assignment,

4932
03:17:13,320 --> 03:17:16,200
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: hindi ba mas magandang train ang ilagay doon rather than kalye?

4933
03:17:16,540 --> 03:17:19,100
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sabi niya, wala tayong magagawa, na loan na pagdating niya doon.

4934
03:17:19,560 --> 03:17:22,540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang loan is 35 billion, binaba natin to 22.

4935
03:17:23,020 --> 03:17:24,820
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Worse sa house, ginawang 8.2.

4936
03:17:25,240 --> 03:17:26,500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, sorry.

4937
03:17:26,840 --> 03:17:29,600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I know, don't get me wrong.

4938
03:17:31,280 --> 03:17:37,320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I remember, Sen. JB, I think the Finance Committee was offered to you before

4939
03:17:37,320 --> 03:17:43,500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: and you know how hard this project is and that's why we appreciate, di ba,

4940
03:17:43,940 --> 03:17:49,060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: during Senator Soto's time as Senate President, also yung kay Wyn, etc.

4941
03:17:49,960 --> 03:17:53,480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: It's so hard to have priority projects ililipat mo.

4942
03:17:53,480 --> 03:17:54,860
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But I go back to the principle.

4943
03:17:55,720 --> 03:17:56,680
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kung well-versed...

4944
03:17:56,840 --> 03:18:00,920
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Well-vetted itong foreign-assisted,

4945
03:18:01,420 --> 03:18:04,700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: bakit tayo ngayon kukuha doon tapos ibibigay sa iba?

4946
03:18:05,320 --> 03:18:08,900
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Na hindi natin sure kung well-vetted yun or hindi.

4947
03:18:09,280 --> 03:18:10,820
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, can I leave this with you?

4948
03:18:10,880 --> 03:18:13,980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: We have time until the end to take a second look at it.

4949
03:18:14,580 --> 03:18:16,780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And one, let's agree in principle.

4950
03:18:16,960 --> 03:18:18,340
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Mas maganda nga ba foreign-assisted?

4951
03:18:18,520 --> 03:18:20,400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Two, if you say yes,

4952
03:18:22,220 --> 03:18:25,140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: bakit natin tatanggalan yung specific projects na yon?

4953
03:18:25,320 --> 03:18:25,400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Di ba?

4954
03:18:26,840 --> 03:18:28,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Actually, Mr. President, Your Honor,

4955
03:18:29,080 --> 03:18:32,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ito po, these projects that you enumerated,

4956
03:18:33,100 --> 03:18:34,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ang house po nagtanggal niya, no?

4957
03:18:35,200 --> 03:18:41,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And these are all, I would say, good foreign-assisted projects.

4958
03:18:41,980 --> 03:18:45,900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya lang po sila, 130 billion ang total that was removed.

4959
03:18:46,600 --> 03:18:53,500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And we tried to restore, but we were only able to raise about 87 billion total.

4960
03:18:53,500 --> 03:18:56,620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So talagang kulang yung na-source natin eh.

4961
03:18:56,840 --> 03:18:59,420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I agree with you, Mr. Chairman.

4962
03:18:59,580 --> 03:19:02,100
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Theoretically, we're confined to do the gab.

4963
03:19:02,900 --> 03:19:05,920
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But pagdating sa BICAM, you can use anything.

4964
03:19:06,060 --> 03:19:08,320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: You can use Senate version, House version, you can use the NEP.

4965
03:19:08,720 --> 03:19:13,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kasi, for example, Davao Transport Modernization, pareho eh.

4966
03:19:13,520 --> 03:19:19,580
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: 15 billion yung NEP, 9.9 at 9.9 din House at saka the Senate eh.

4967
03:19:20,220 --> 03:19:23,700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yung tama ka, let's say, dun sa Laguna Lake,

4968
03:19:26,840 --> 03:19:30,900
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: eto, sa panahon ng pagkilos, yung World Bank,

4969
03:19:31,340 --> 03:19:34,120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: 17 billion, 12.1, 12.1 eh.

4970
03:19:34,200 --> 03:19:36,120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Both House and Senate, 12.1 eh.

4971
03:19:36,780 --> 03:19:39,980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Philippine Digital, pareho eh, House at Senate.

4972
03:19:40,320 --> 03:19:43,760
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, ang hindi ko lang na kasi matanggap yung principle,

4973
03:19:44,480 --> 03:19:48,700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: nasasabihin natin, well-vetted yung, huwag natin palitan yun.

4974
03:19:49,180 --> 03:19:54,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So now we're saying, kailangan natin maghanap para sa bagong projects na gusto natin lagyan.

4975
03:19:54,720 --> 03:19:56,820
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pero is it as well-vetted as the other?

4976
03:19:56,820 --> 03:19:59,820
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: We all agree, hindi.

4977
03:20:00,760 --> 03:20:06,500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So why move money to a less efficient program when you have a more efficient program?

4978
03:20:07,100 --> 03:20:08,240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: That's my point there.

4979
03:20:08,300 --> 03:20:12,820
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But I'll be more than happy for you to review, but I'll definitely bring this up again.

4980
03:20:14,120 --> 03:20:17,380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Can I bring up one point also there, Mr. Chairman?

4981
03:20:18,740 --> 03:20:23,480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: May bagong lumang requirements for infrastructure projects,

4982
03:20:23,480 --> 03:20:26,460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: bago natin ipsama sa, sa ano?

4983
03:20:26,820 --> 03:20:32,340
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sa JA, na dapat RDC, dapat, et cetera, et cetera, na?

4984
03:20:34,880 --> 03:20:37,360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So eto, from DPWH daw to.

4985
03:20:37,800 --> 03:20:41,020
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And strictly daw sinusunod ng ating LBRMO.

4986
03:20:41,600 --> 03:20:47,640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Approved Program of Works, Validated JUTAG, Budget Preparation Compliance,

4987
03:20:48,180 --> 03:20:54,360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Certificate of Implementability, Master Plan or Feasibility, RDC, et cetera.

4988
03:20:54,360 --> 03:20:56,720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Baka itong Master Plan at Feasibility ang problema.

4989
03:20:56,820 --> 03:21:01,800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: If you have a 5 billion peso project, pero 3 phases.

4990
03:21:02,780 --> 03:21:05,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: First year, 1.5 billion, 2025.

4991
03:21:06,020 --> 03:21:09,380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Second phase, 2026, 1.5 billion, 3 billion.

4992
03:21:09,920 --> 03:21:13,180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: 2027, 2 billion, matatapos na.

4993
03:21:14,000 --> 03:21:16,020
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pero wala sa requirements na to.

4994
03:21:17,140 --> 03:21:20,440
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ititiwangwang na lang natin yung project na 3 billion na ginastos natin.

4995
03:21:22,400 --> 03:21:24,500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I'm saying it's a productive project, ha?

4996
03:21:24,500 --> 03:21:25,720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Never mind.

4997
03:21:25,900 --> 03:21:26,460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Never mind.

4998
03:21:26,820 --> 03:21:31,040
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Of course, if it's a ghost project, hindi itiwangwang yung 3 billion, ninakaw na.

4999
03:21:33,180 --> 03:21:35,400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I've talked to a lot of local officials.

5000
03:21:36,080 --> 03:21:39,500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi sila makakumply sa binigay nitong DP.

5001
03:21:39,800 --> 03:21:40,960
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pero may ongoing sila.

5002
03:21:41,080 --> 03:21:44,080
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hospital, Coliseum, Port.

5003
03:21:45,520 --> 03:21:50,400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, for me, mas importante ang substance than forma.

5004
03:21:50,800 --> 03:21:53,200
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Baka napakagaling natin pumorma sa budget.

5005
03:21:53,200 --> 03:21:54,260
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ito ang mga requirements.

5006
03:21:54,720 --> 03:21:56,800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sa 2027, we assure you.

5007
03:21:56,820 --> 03:22:00,720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Walang wastage ang pera eto.

5008
03:22:01,200 --> 03:22:04,540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi, mawe-waste nga yun kasi pinondohan mo na the last few years.

5009
03:22:05,100 --> 03:22:09,020
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pero hindi matatapos ngayon because of some bureaucratic problem.

5010
03:22:09,720 --> 03:22:16,760
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, Mr. Chairman, can the DPWH not submit pag ongoing, then justify it, then to follow yung ku-anuman?

5011
03:22:17,600 --> 03:22:23,240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I mean, if you already spent 3 billion for 5 billion projects, saka mo gagawa ng feasibility study or master plan.

5012
03:22:23,240 --> 03:22:26,240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And if these projects were implemented by the...

5013
03:22:26,820 --> 03:22:28,980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: regional or the district engineer,

5014
03:22:29,960 --> 03:22:30,180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: di ba?

5015
03:22:30,520 --> 03:22:38,220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: You don't expect them na suddenly, 2-3 months before, we tell them na ilagay itong requirements na to.

5016
03:22:39,660 --> 03:22:41,840
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I told Secretary Vins the same thing.

5017
03:22:42,320 --> 03:22:51,500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sabi ko, Secretary Vins, because of the media, kinansel mo lahat ng flood control programs nung top 10, top 15 na mukhang may problema.

5018
03:22:52,000 --> 03:22:56,500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sabi ko, pag kinansel mo yan, rather than i-confiscate mo yung bond at patapusin,

5019
03:22:56,820 --> 03:22:58,700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: patapusin mo sila, tiwangwang yan.

5020
03:22:59,500 --> 03:23:02,360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: O, nung budget hearing, inamin niya, tiwangwang.

5021
03:23:02,920 --> 03:23:05,900
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pero nung una, nung una niyang buwan, sabi niya, hindi, may kukuha niyan.

5022
03:23:06,320 --> 03:23:09,280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kami bahala, sasabihin namin sa ibang contractor, kunin niyo yan.

5023
03:23:09,960 --> 03:23:12,100
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Andami natin projects ngayon, nakatiwangwang.

5024
03:23:12,600 --> 03:23:17,020
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, double whammy, we slowed down, and then hindi usable yung project na iyon.

5025
03:23:17,100 --> 03:23:18,320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, I'll give you an example.

5026
03:23:18,860 --> 03:23:23,800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: A hospital that just needs 200 million to be completed, you already spent 800 million.

5027
03:23:24,900 --> 03:23:25,560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Nakatiwangwang yan.

5028
03:23:25,820 --> 03:23:26,740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, double.

5029
03:23:26,820 --> 03:23:29,080
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: You don't only lose the 800 million.

5030
03:23:29,640 --> 03:23:31,400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: You don't only save the 200 million.

5031
03:23:31,580 --> 03:23:33,600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi magamit kasi hindi patapos.

5032
03:23:34,180 --> 03:23:36,600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, may I maybe convert this to an appeal.

5033
03:23:36,680 --> 03:23:38,400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I don't know exactly these projects.

5034
03:23:39,160 --> 03:23:43,040
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pero ang dami kong kausap, Senator JV, di ba?

5035
03:23:43,520 --> 03:23:48,840
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: There are very, very few rules in the world that doesn't have exceptions.

5036
03:23:49,380 --> 03:23:52,080
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Especially if you implement the rule ng apurahan.

5037
03:23:52,080 --> 03:23:56,640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: If you had this rule for two years, and hindi sinunod ngayon,

5038
03:23:56,820 --> 03:23:59,540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: wala kang sisisihin kung hindi yung agency.

5039
03:24:00,200 --> 03:24:00,420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Di ba?

5040
03:24:01,000 --> 03:24:03,640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, ayokong si Sec Lopez naman ngayon.

5041
03:24:03,760 --> 03:24:04,580
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Baka umikot yun.

5042
03:24:04,700 --> 03:24:05,620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Magmura, magturo.

5043
03:24:06,340 --> 03:24:08,880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: E yung project na to, tapos pag tinignan niya,

5044
03:24:09,220 --> 03:24:12,800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: eh sir, kaya tinutubuan na ng halaman yan,

5045
03:24:12,980 --> 03:24:15,120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: kasi hindi naman pinunduhan ng Congress for 2020.

5046
03:24:15,260 --> 03:24:15,780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Bakit wala?

5047
03:24:16,900 --> 03:24:19,440
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pero may pondo siya ng 26, 25, 24.

5048
03:24:20,440 --> 03:24:22,340
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, if we really want an efficient budget,

5049
03:24:22,340 --> 03:24:24,520
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: we have to see the realities on the ground.

5050
03:24:25,100 --> 03:24:25,940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Not only the...

5051
03:24:25,940 --> 03:24:29,720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: what looks good in media and on paper.

5052
03:24:29,880 --> 03:24:32,680
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, yun lang appeal ko between now and by come.

5053
03:24:33,360 --> 03:24:35,460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Allow the LGUs, allow the congressmen.

5054
03:24:36,640 --> 03:24:39,060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: You know, minsan nadidemonize masyado na,

5055
03:24:39,340 --> 03:24:40,800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: congressman, nasisingit ng project.

5056
03:24:41,360 --> 03:24:43,980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: They're there to represent their constituents.

5057
03:24:44,260 --> 03:24:46,600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, if I was a congressman now, Senator JV,

5058
03:24:46,700 --> 03:24:48,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: at may hospital sa Taguig,

5059
03:24:48,440 --> 03:24:51,240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: na, let's say, 1 billion peso hospital,

5060
03:24:51,240 --> 03:24:52,760
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: 800 million na nagastos,

5061
03:24:52,900 --> 03:24:54,740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: hindi ma-operate without the 200 million,

5062
03:24:54,740 --> 03:24:57,140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: hindi maipasok ngayon sa GAA.

5063
03:24:57,920 --> 03:24:59,340
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Mahiya akong ipasok yun

5064
03:24:59,340 --> 03:25:01,680
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: because walang requirement

5065
03:25:01,680 --> 03:25:03,880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: or it's my duty as a congressman to say na,

5066
03:25:04,240 --> 03:25:05,440
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: if you were a mayor now,

5067
03:25:06,180 --> 03:25:08,860
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: na hindi mo mailapit

5068
03:25:08,860 --> 03:25:10,540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: dahil kagalit mo yung congressman

5069
03:25:10,540 --> 03:25:12,860
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: or sa senador mo nilapit,

5070
03:25:13,220 --> 03:25:14,040
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: pero yung senador na yun,

5071
03:25:14,180 --> 03:25:15,460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: anong isasagot natin?

5072
03:25:15,820 --> 03:25:17,360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ma'am, maganda yung ospital,

5073
03:25:17,520 --> 03:25:19,840
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: pero sorry ha, yung binigay na DPWH na papel,

5074
03:25:20,400 --> 03:25:21,480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: kailangan naming sundin.

5075
03:25:22,300 --> 03:25:24,580
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi mapapagamot nung papel na to yung...

5076
03:25:24,580 --> 03:25:26,540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: kayang ipagamot nung ospital na yun.

5077
03:25:26,620 --> 03:25:28,280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, may I appeal to you, Mr. Chairman,

5078
03:25:28,440 --> 03:25:29,740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: to take a look at that.

5079
03:25:29,820 --> 03:25:31,860
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I'm not asking na you change the rules.

5080
03:25:32,520 --> 03:25:35,500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I'm asking you to look at the legitimate exceptions

5081
03:25:35,500 --> 03:25:41,420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: that will bring harm to the 2027 budget.

5082
03:25:53,060 --> 03:25:54,480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yes or no, Mr. Chairman?

5083
03:25:54,580 --> 03:25:55,680
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Are you fixed with that?

5084
03:25:55,680 --> 03:25:56,540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yes, Mr. President.

5085
03:25:57,260 --> 03:25:58,680
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, I'm waiting for your answer.

5086
03:25:59,380 --> 03:26:01,320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: You are a very kind-hearted person,

5087
03:26:01,440 --> 03:26:03,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: but I do not assume a yes from you always.

5088
03:26:03,360 --> 03:26:04,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Actually, yung...

5089
03:26:04,340 --> 03:26:08,980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: With regards to the uncompleted,

5090
03:26:09,220 --> 03:26:11,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: yung mga projects that are ongoing,

5091
03:26:12,140 --> 03:26:13,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: one of the policies right now,

5092
03:26:14,180 --> 03:26:15,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kahit fraud control pa yan,

5093
03:26:15,880 --> 03:26:17,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: basta for completion,

5094
03:26:20,140 --> 03:26:21,500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ano yan, itutuloy natin,

5095
03:26:21,580 --> 03:26:22,960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we'll finish para po maging,

5096
03:26:22,960 --> 03:26:24,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at least hindi po nasayang,

5097
03:26:24,580 --> 03:26:26,460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: so basta't hindi palpak yung project

5098
03:26:26,460 --> 03:26:27,400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: and for completion.

5099
