6873
04:56:44,140 --> 04:56:48,200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So if, unfortunately, I think DA doesn't have it.

6874
04:56:48,220 --> 04:56:52,360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I'm not aware that DA has.

6875
04:56:52,880 --> 04:56:59,600
