6876
04:56:59,940 --> 04:57:00,880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It really isn't.

6877
04:57:02,160 --> 04:57:07,520
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That really is the purpose of having a futures thinking office that doesn't do anything but solely predict the future.

6878
04:57:08,160 --> 04:57:09,400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Why do we have to do that?

6879
04:57:09,400 --> 04:57:17,940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Well, it is our job to create programs and to fund programs that will ensure intergenerational fairness.

6880
04:57:18,520 --> 04:57:20,440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So again, I said this before, this is not new.

